// Shared base config — committed and public. Do not put a real team ID,
// distribution bundle identifier, org ID, project ID, API key, or anything
// else identifying to a private account in this file.
//
// For a local device or TestFlight build, copy Local.xcconfig.example to
// Local.xcconfig (same directory) and fill in your own values. Local.xcconfig
// is gitignored, so it's picked up here via an optional include and never
// committed or published. Without it, the project builds exactly as it does
// for anyone who clones the sample: unsigned-for-device, generic bundle id,
// placeholder org/project identifiers, and no preconfigured API key.
//
// For Xcode Cloud, the ci_post_clone.sh script writes a Local.xcconfig from
// environment variables — see that script for the required variable names.
FINANCE_DEMO_BUNDLE_ID = com.example.MetabindFinanceDemo
FINANCE_DEMO_ORG_ID = YOUR_ORG_ID
FINANCE_DEMO_PROJECT_ID = YOUR_PROJECT_ID
FINANCE_DEMO_API_KEY =
DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =

#include? "Local.xcconfig"
